 AI agent skill for Claude Code
 ✗ A different skill called devpit is already there, so Devpit will not install its own.
   Remove or rename that devpit folder yourself if you want Devpit's skill instead.

 What it lets Claude Code do
   Check which account each tool uses in a folder and explain why, by running Devpit's read-only
   commands and reading its help pages. It can suggest a change and make it once you agree.

 What it never does
   ✓ Never changes anything without your yes: it asks first, every time.
   ✓ Never reads account folders, login files or tokens.

 Where it goes
   default  C:\Users\you\.claude\skills\devpit\SKILL.md                       ✗ not Devpit's
            A devpit skill Devpit did not write.
   work     C:\Users\you\.devpit\accounts\claude\work\skills\devpit\SKILL.md  ✗ not Devpit's
            A devpit folder without Devpit's SKILL.md, holding other files.







